  "name": "Cheesy Garlic Bread",
  "subtitle": "A crisp, savory loaf with a rich cheese topping",
  "description": "Softened butter, mayonnaise, garlic, onions, and two cheeses are spread over French bread, baked, then briefly grilled until bubbling and golden.",
  "meal_type": "baked-good",
  "cuisine": "American",
